@startuml
!pragma layout smetana
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam defaultFontSize 14
skinparam shadowing false
hide circle
skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0
hide empty members
title Fee statements: read-only access to saved lesson data

class TutorLedger {
  {static} +main(args)
}
class PaymentCommands {
  {static} +handles(input) : boolean
  +execute(input) : String
  -feeStatement(studentId) : String
}
class TutorLedgerData {
  +getStudent(id) : Student
  +getLessons() : Collection<Lesson>
}
class Student {
  +getStudentId() : String
  +getName() : String
}
class Lesson {
  +getLessonId() : String
  +getStudentId() : String
  +getDate() : LocalDate
  +getTime() : LocalTime
  +getSubject() : String
  +getFee() : BigDecimal
  +getAmountPaid() : BigDecimal
  +getPaymentStatus() : String
}

TutorLedger ..> PaymentCommands : routes commands
PaymentCommands --> TutorLedgerData : reads shared data
TutorLedgerData "1" *--> "0..*" Student : stores
TutorLedgerData "1" *--> "0..*" Lesson : stores
PaymentCommands ..> Student : reads identity
PaymentCommands ..> Lesson : reads saved charges and payments

note bottom of PaymentCommands
  Builds the statement when requested.
  No separate statement record is stored.
end note
@enduml
